# ResourcePopover: steps from parity/shell_modules_resources_ResourcePopover.qml.md (batches 1-5). Screen IRICE-TEST 1920x1080 scale 1;
# the island is centred at x 960 (closed y ~14, open ~392 wide); the bar is 30 px tall.
# Each block runs in both looks: the file runs top to bottom, Material first, then Glass.

look material
ptr move 1500 600
wait 1
ptr glide 960 14 400
wait 1
wait 10
ptr glide 925 49 200
wait 0.8
shot pop
note 3-4 rows (Graphics only with an AMD/Intel GPU), round tinted badges, titles, details ("NN°C", "N.N of N GB"), values right-aligned, graphs spanning most of their width
wait 1.5
shot pop-later
note figures/graph tips changed; nothing else redrawn (compare with pop)
static pop-rows 760 60 400 240
note the popover's rows: only figures and graphs change over 3 s (no row rebuilt)
ptr glide 960 700 300
wait 1
ptr move 1500 600
wait 1
ptr glide 960 14 400
wait 1
rec pop-in 1 ptr glide 925 49 150
note it fades in and drops 6 px over Theme.motion.popover (not one frame)
ptr glide 960 700 300
wait 1

look glass
ptr move 1500 600
wait 1
ptr glide 960 14 400
wait 1
wait 10
ptr glide 925 49 200
wait 0.8
shot pop
note 3-4 rows (Graphics only with an AMD/Intel GPU), round tinted badges, titles, details ("NN°C", "N.N of N GB"), values right-aligned, graphs spanning most of their width
wait 1.5
shot pop-later
note figures/graph tips changed; nothing else redrawn (compare with pop)
static pop-rows 760 60 400 240
note the popover's rows: only figures and graphs change over 3 s (no row rebuilt)
ptr glide 960 700 300
wait 1
ptr move 1500 600
wait 1
ptr glide 960 14 400
wait 1
rec pop-in 1 ptr glide 925 49 150
note it fades in and drops 6 px over Theme.motion.popover (not one frame)
ptr glide 960 700 300
wait 1
